				<wikidot:authorName>Melissanoma</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3260593</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The beginning section refers to a &quot;<em>Mr Prosecutor</em>&quot;, but after the first scp doc insert it switches to &quot;<em>Mr Persecutor</em>&quot;. A ctrl F for <em>pros</em> and <em>pers</em> will show it.</p> <p>Both are words with similar meanings, so I don't know if this was a translation error or what.</p> 
				 	]]>
