				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13608785/they#post-4737868</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2020 00:52:56 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Tuomey Tombstone</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>462110</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I enjoy this sort of alt-universe thing and this concept in particular is pretty intriguing. Dialogue is solid, although the format is a little tricky to follow at times.</p> <p>The diagram for the SCP document is pretty solid; more SCPs should have clear diagrams like that where possible, rather than getting into dense explanations.</p> <p>Also, I fixed a typo.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
